Secure Crops for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Secure Crops 2.0.1 by zekk051.
Original source: https://github.com/zekk051/secure-crops
Original licence: MIT (the release's licence; the source repository also carries CC0-1.0)

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the rules are re-implemented in
Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). The translations in assets/ and icon.png
are the original's. This port is distributed under the original's licence (MIT); the licence text
is in LICENSE.
